EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Do you have a minute, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
I need some help with my
catchphrase, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Oh, you see? {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Can't you tell?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
It feels weak, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}. I need a
new, powerful one, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
But what do YOU think?
Does "{{TAG:0005:0007:}}" still suit me?{{TAG:0008:0005:0400150003002800}}
Nah, change it!
I think it's fine.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}¿Tienes un minuto, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Necesito que me eches una mano
con mi muletilla, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Oh, ¿lo ves? {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Suena gastada,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
sin fuerza. Necesito una nueva
urgentemente, terroncín.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Pero antes quiero saber tu opinión.
¿Debo cambiar de muletilla?{{TAG:0008:0005:0400150003002800}}
¡Sí, hazlo!
No, a mí me gusta

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Hai un minutino, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Ho bisogno del tuo aiuto. Si tratta
del mio intercalare, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
Beh, è un po' antiquato, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Come, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}non te ne sei accort{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Ne vorrei uno nuovo, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
Tu cosa ne pensi? Credi che
"{{TAG:0005:0007:}}" mi si addica ancora?{{TAG:0008:0005:0400150003002800}}
Meglio cambiare!
Va bene così!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Bir dakikan var mı, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Sürekli kullandığım söz konusunda biraz
yardıma ihtiyacım var, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Ah, görmüyor musun? {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Belli değil mi?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Gücünü kaybetti, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}. Daha
etkileyici bir şeye ihtiyacım var, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
Ama SEN ne düşünüyorsun?
“{{TAG:0005:0007:}}” hâlâ bana yakışıyor mu?{{TAG:0008:0005:0400150003002800}}
Yok, değiştir!
Bence iyi.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I need some advice, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
It's about a little problem I have
with, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}well, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}my catchphrase.
You know, that little touch I throw
in once in a while, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Yes, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}that right there, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
It's sounding bland, so I'm thinking
of changing it, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
What should I do?{{TAG:0008:0005:0400150003002800}}
Change it!
Keep it.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Vorrei il tuo parere, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ho un problemino. Si tratta{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} del mio
intercalare.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} {{TAG:0003:0009:}}Hai capito bene!
È un'espressione personale che
uso di tanto in tanto, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Sì, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}l'ho appena usata, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
Vorrei cambiarla, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Cosa devo fare? Aiutami!{{TAG:0008:0005:0400150003002800}}
Cambiala!
Va bene così!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Biraz akla ihtiyacım var, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Şeyle ilgili küçük bir sorunum var,
{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}şey, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}sürekli kullandığım sözle.
Hani arada cümlelerime serpiştirdiğim
şu küçük dokunuş var ya, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Evet, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}tam da o, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
Biraz yavan gelmeye başladı; değiştirmeyi
düşünüyorum, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Ne yapmalıyım?{{TAG:0008:0005:0400150003002800}}
Değiştir!
Böyle kalsın.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Really? You think I should keep it?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Well, if you say so, I'll hang on to it
a little longer, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}O sea, ¿que no debo cambiarla?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bueno, si tú lo dices será verdad,
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Gerçekten mi? Böyle kalsın mı diyorsun?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Peki, sen öyle diyorsan bir süre daha
tutarım, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Wusste ich es doch!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Was soll ich denn von
nun an sagen, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}?

ES:
Venga, que lo pruebo, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0007:}}¡Oiga! {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}¡Camarero, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
¡Creo que hay una mosca en mi
{{TAG:0005:0013:0000}}, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}¡Ay, corazoncito! ¡Es perfecta! {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
¡Incluso cuando me quejo suena
de maravilla!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ora tutti quanti vorranno copiare{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
il mio intercalare. I problemi non
finiscono mai, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Me gusta, no tardaré en
acostumbrarme, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
¡Gracias por la ayuda!
